From abdc40fb5b19c2d7816f900f315f0b8c760874fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:31:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] engine: one mechanism for 1-4 users - the solo pipeline
 and up to four spec lanes in shared VRAM (opt-in STRATA_SPEC_LANES=2..4)

STRATA_SPEC_LANES=N (2..4) is up to N lanes on slots 0, GS, 2 GS, 3 GS and folds the solo pipeline in
(STRATA_SOLO_PIPELINE unset: on; =0: the lanes alone).  One user: the pipelined solo path (GEN); 2..N
lane slots decoding and nothing else: one lane each; more users or any refusal: the batch pump.
- shared arenas (STRATA_LC_SHARE, default on): lane 0's verifier carves the stage's main verifier's arena,
  lane 1's the solo pipeline's second verifier's (set_external_arena, carve signature checked); lanes 2 and
  3 own theirs, the front stages' GDN snapshots move into lane 2's.  =0: an arena per lane, as M1b.
- the boot picks the lane count: the most for which every card keeps kVramSafeMib + 256 MiB after what is
  still made lazily (STRATA_LC_LAZY_MIB, 141), estimated before (spec_lanes::fit_lanes), checked after (the
  top lane goes); fewer than two: no lanes.  No loans, the experts' caches unchanged (the reserve per card
  is at most M1b's 400 MiB).
- the solo pipeline's graphs are captured at boot with the lanes asked; the lanes' graphs only up to the
  MTP's window (review M3).
- lc_fence at every lane start syncs the main and second verifiers', the snapshots' side, the drafters' and
  the lanes' streams (review H1); pl_drain waits for the snapshots' side streams too.
- gates: start with 2 (STRATA_SPEC_LANES_ONE: 1) .. N lane slots; running lanes go on while one lane slot
  decodes (STRATA_SPEC_LANES_KEEP=0: M1b's drain); HOLD=k; CATCHUP_MAX=n; the last stage still runs one lane
  window at a time and each waits for the other lanes' chains (SERIAL3).
- STRATA_LC_POISON=<byte> fills every shared arena at each switch into and out of the lanes (review H2).
Env unset: the default path as before (the new code hangs off lanes_asked / lanes_on); kernels
SASS-identical to Strata-ll3-lanes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
